flowchart TD
  A[Discover source without edits] --> B[Classify every object]
  B --> C[Compare generated and imported targets]
  C --> D{Blocking semantic finding?}
  D -- yes --> E[BLOCKED_PENDING_REVIEW]
  E --> F[Accept, correct, or reject each finding]
  D -- no --> G[READY_FOR_REVIEW]
  F --> H[Regenerate from typed canonical IR]
  H --> I[Run equivalence checks]
  I --> J{All candidate checks pass?}
  J -- no --> K[NOT_ACCEPTED]
  J -- yes --> L[READY_FOR_GOVERNED_FINALIZATION]
  L --> M[Separate final human approval]
